flowchart TD
    A[Enterprise Data Inputs<br/>POS Sales, Promotions, Pricing, Costs, Calendar] --> B[Ingestion and Data Quality Checks]
    B --> C[Feature Engineering<br/>Revenue, Margin, Profit, Loss, Elasticity, Lift]
    C --> D[(MongoDB RGM Database)]

    D --> E1[Pricing Engine<br/>ML if available, else data-driven]
    D --> E2[Promotion Engine<br/>ML if available, else simulation rules]
    D --> E3[Assortment Engine<br/>ML if available, else recommendation rules]
    D --> E4[Forecasting Engine<br/>ML-only forecast generation]

    E1 --> F[FastAPI Service Layer<br/>/api/pricing/insight]
    E2 --> F
    E3 --> F
    E4 --> F
    D --> F

    G[Supabase Auth<br/>User Session and Access Control] --> H[React Frontend<br/>Overview, Pricing, Promotions, Assortment, Forecasting]
    F --> H

    H --> I[Commercial Decisions<br/>Price change, Promo plan, SKU action, Demand plan]
    I --> J[Business Execution<br/>Retail and Foodservice market actions]
    J --> K[Performance Outcomes<br/>Revenue up, Margin leakage down, Loss reduction]
    K --> A
